# Control flow: an unconditional jump, a subroutine call, and a branch.

# Jump over the subroutine body so it runs only when called.
Jump .main

# double: replaces the top of the stack with twice its value
.double
Dup
+
Return

.main
# 21 doubled is 42
21
Call .double
io.print CallNative 1

# JumpIfFalse takes a boolean: true falls through, false jumps to .done.
true
JumpIfFalse .done
99
io.print CallNative 1

.done
Return
